{"at":"2026-10-17T21:25:06.063Z","component":"In-app notification scheduler cancellation and resource lifetime","evidence":["50b0f3a1a0d3700c8591521f370d8cdb006e1202afac538709d6c227711c7eaa","6f5fe3d1da79d68b81b19604200e2e227d608be1e77eed1523f13f075998df52","7e02e4a7bf840ae54e88d533e81b9e4be4cbcb7e0c44835faa76f269231bbc3c","82224323ccae41d4a13be1762a0f8aae3eac3419697915132f0b2606d25c8a33","88782a47cba946acf3cc6f7db0a0188ce19c9199fc5b221f10659acedfb34af4","c2cbe773712628a24866e6a04e40404fa5ed99ad233ec71693ffc470cbb31b14","c5f39687bd092f1407f7612439fd09208e941ec2870ece1eef5e26f5668af1db","e08ef775b4ecd35d55bb2f53ab2342d9563b00e403f56c4d3d1db5ef35884954","e6983e6a82839053c0d3b7c1ad500f607e9cfe1d494017194d246326c4363f9e"],"id":"1cd0eea94c4dced95e57595167d9a460cc3c53302c385d7176f92490d2cd4c5e","kind":"lesson","paths":["mail/components/inappnotifications/content/in-app-notification-manager.mjs","mail/components/inappnotifications/modules/InAppNotifications.sys.mjs","mail/components/inappnotifications/modules/NotificationManager.sys.mjs","mail/components/inappnotifications/modules/NotificationOpener.sys.mjs","mail/components/inappnotifications/modules/NotificationScheduler.sys.mjs","mail/components/inappnotifications/moz.build","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/browser.toml","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/browser_disabled.toml","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/browser_inAppNotificationEnterprisePolicies.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/browser_inAppNotificationFocus.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/browser_inAppNotificationIntegration.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/browser_inAppNotificationManager.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/browser_inAppNotificationScheduler.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/browser_inAppNotificationSchedulerBrowserPosition.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/browser_inAppNotificationSchedulerMultiWindow.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/browser_inAppNotificationSchedulerNoUi.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/browser_inAppNotificationSchedulerPosition.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/browser_inAppNotificationSchedulerTabPosition.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/files/inAppNotificationManager.xhtml","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/browser/head.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/unit/test_notification_manager.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/unit/test_notification_manager_telemetry.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/unit/test_notification_opener.js","mail/components/inappnotifications/test/unit/xpcshell.toml"],"quotes":[{"id":"6f5fe3d1da79d68b81b19604200e2e227d608be1e77eed1523f13f075998df52","text":"      if (!currentWindow && !currentState.onScreen && activeWindow) {\n        interval = lazy.setInterval(callback, 5000);"},{"id":"6f5fe3d1da79d68b81b19604200e2e227d608be1e77eed1523f13f075998df52","text":"      if (interval) {\n        lazy.clearInterval(interval);\n      }"}],"repository":"thunderbird","source":{"basis":"Quoted evidence supports the claim; its interpretation still needs current-source checks.","revision":"9606e60c42063c5e7870b7843ce1524e3119f125","sourceAt":"2025-04-01T16:45:23Z","type":"extraction"},"status":"supported","supersedes":[],"text":"For a no-currentWindow offscreen wait, each qualifying callback assigns a fresh setInterval(callback,5000) without checking an existing interval; only the latest stored handle is cleared. Repeated offscreen callbacks can therefore leave an older handle beyond this cleanup. A focused fake-timer test should keep one polling handle while offscreen and remove all handles on settlement/reset. No timer-count experiment ran. The related current id field begins null and is assigned only inside the already-truthy/different-id branch; broader notification replacement behavior remains a separate unexecuted scope, not a proven cause. Full earlier D239335 discussion remains unavailable. This is a public source-only scoped investigation/test proposal, not an accepted new rule or executed failure.","title":"Keep a single tracked timer for a no-window offscreen notification wait","version":1,"visibility":"shared"}
